#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:57
msgid ""
"Fill out the additional information when prompted, and :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr "Täytä pyydetyt lisätiedot ja :guilabel:`jatka`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:58
