#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/latvia.rst:11
msgid "Legal framework for e-invoicing in Latvia"
msgstr "Sähköistä laskutusta koskeva oikeudellinen kehys Latviassa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/latvia.rst:13
msgid ""
"In Latvia, electronic invoicing is governed by the `Law on Accounting "
"<https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/LV/TXT/PDF/?"
"uri=CELEX:72014L0055LVA_270633>`_ and regulations aligned with `EU Directive "
"2014/55/EU <https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?"
"uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_, mandating the use of e-invoicing in :abbr:`B2G "
"(business-to-government)` transactions. All public sector invoices must be "
"sent in the European Standard EN 16931 format through platforms such as "
"eInvoicing.lv, Latvia’s official e-invoicing infrastructure. Latvia is also "
"connected to the Peppol network, facilitating standardized cross-border e-"
"invoicing across the European Union."
msgstr ""
"Latviassa sähköistä laskutusta säätelee `kirjanpitolaki <https://eur-"
"lex.europa.eu/legal-content/LV/TXT/PDF/?uri=CELEX:72014L0055LVA_270633>`_ ja "
"`EU-direktiivin 2014/55/EU <https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?"
"uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_ mukaiset säädökset, jotka edellyttävät sähköisen "
"laskutuksen käyttöä :abbr:`B2G (yritys-hallitus)` -transaktioissa. Kaikki "
"julkisen sektorin laskut on lähetettävä eurooppalaisen standardin EN 16931 "
"mukaisessa muodossa alustojen, kuten eInvoicing.lv:n, kautta, joka on "
"Latvian virallinen sähköisen laskutuksen infrastruktuuri. Latvia on myös "
"liitetty Peppol-verkkoon, mikä helpottaa standardoitua rajat ylittävää "
"sähköistä laskutusta koko Euroopan unionissa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/latvia.rst:21
msgid "Compliance with Latvian e-invoicing regulations"
msgstr "Latvian sähköisen laskutuksen säädösten noudattaminen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/latvia.rst:23
msgid ""
"Odoo Invoicing is designed to help businesses comply with Latvia's specific "
"e-invoicing requirements. Here is how Odoo ensures compliance:"
msgstr ""
