#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:109
msgid ""
"The :doc:`chart of accounts <get_started/chart_of_accounts>` is the "
"foundation of all accounting records, and as such, it needs to be created "
"before other database records. A standard chart of accounts is included with "
"each fiscal localization, but most businesses have their own chart of "
"accounts with its own accounts. Some of these accounts likely serve the same "
"purpose as some of Odoo's standard accounts, but they may have a different "
"name and/or code. Other accounts may not have an analogous account in Odoo's "
"standard chart of accounts. These two types of accounts should be handled "
"differently:"
msgstr ""
"The :doc:`tilikartta <get_started/chart_of_accounts>` on kaikkien "
"kirjanpitotietojen perusta, ja siksi se on luotava ennen muita tietokannan "
"tietueita. Jokainen fiskaalinen lokalisointi sisältää vakiotilikartan, mutta "
"useimmilla yrityksillä on oma tilikarttansa omine tileineen. Jotkin näistä "
"tileistä todennäköisesti palvelevat samaa tarkoitusta kuin Odoon vakiotilit, "
"mutta niillä voi olla eri nimi ja/tai koodi. Toisilla tileillä ei "
"välttämättä ole vastaavaa tiliä Odoon vakiotilikartassa. Näitä kahta "
"tilityyppiä tulisi käsitellä eri tavalla:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:117
msgid ""
"For accounts in your chart that have an analogous account in Odoo's standard "
"chart of accounts, simply edit the account name and/or account code of the "
"standard Odoo account to match your own."
msgstr ""
"Jos tilikartassasi olevalla tilillä on vastaava tili Odoon "
"vakiotilikartassa, muokkaa Odoon vakiotilin nimeä ja/tai tilikoodia "
"vastaamaan omaasi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:119
msgid ""
"For accounts in your chart that do not have an analogous account in Odoo's "
"standard chart of accounts, create them manually or :ref:`import <essentials/"
"export_import_data/import-data>` them."
msgstr ""
"Jos tilikartassasi oleville tileille ei ole vastaavaa tiliä Odoon "
"vakiotilikartassa, luo ne manuaalisesti tai :ref:`tuo <essentials/"
"export_import_data/import-data>` ne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:123
msgid ""
"Account codes, if used, must be unique per chart of accounts, so ensure that "
"any newly created or imported accounts do not share the same code as an "
"existing account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:127
msgid ""
"Because certain standard accounts are set as the default accounts for "
"various fields (on products, product categories, contacts, and in the "
"Accounting settings), **deleting them or changing their account type can "
"break basic processes** like creating an invoice. Instead of deleting "
"accounts in Odoo's standard chart of accounts, simply rename and recode them."
msgstr ""
"Koska tietyt vakiotilit on määritetty oletustileiksi eri kentille "
"(tuotteissa, tuotekategorioissa, yhteystiedoissa ja Kirjanpidon asetuksissa)"
", **niiden poistaminen tai tilin tyypin muuttaminen voi rikkoa "
"perustoimintoja**, kuten laskun luomisen. Älä poista tilejä Odoon "
"vakiotilikartasta, vaan nimeä ja koodaa ne uudelleen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:133
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorial: Update your chart of accounts <https://www.odoo.com/slides/"
"slide/update-your-chart-of-accounts-6391>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo-opastus: Päivitä tilikarttasi <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/"
"update-your-chart-of-accounts-6391>`_"

