#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:244
msgid ""
"To send payments to vendors (such as with :ref:`SEPA credit transfer "
"<accounting/sepa_payments/sct>` or :doc:`NACHA <../fiscal_localizations/"
"united_states>` files) and collect payments from customers via :ref:`SEPA "
"direct debit <accounting/sepa_payments/sdd>`, the customer's or vendor's "
"bank account must be set on their contact record."
msgstr ""
