#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:421
msgid "Customer name (must exactly match a contact record in Odoo)"
msgstr "Asiakkaan nimi (on vastattava tarkalleen Odoon yhteystietotietuetta)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:422
msgid "Number"
msgstr "Numero"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:423
msgid ""
"Invoice number (e.g., BILL/2026/00001): This number must **not** already "
"exist in this database yet; otherwise, it will have to be :doc:`resequenced "
"<customer_invoices/sequence>`"
msgstr ""
"Laskun numero (esim. BILL/2026/00001): Tämä numero **ei** saa vielä olla "
"olemassa tässä tietokannassa; muuten se on :doc:`numeroitava uudelleen "
"<customer_invoices/sequence>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:425
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:647
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:697
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "Viite"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:426
msgid ""
"(Optional) Invoice reference (i.e., the name of the document that created "
"this invoice)"
msgstr "(Valinnainen) Laskun viite (eli laskun luoneen asiakirjan nimi)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:427
msgid "Invoice Bill Date"
msgstr "Laskun päiväys"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:428
msgid ""
"Date the invoice was created. Ensure the year in the :guilabel:`Number` and "
"the year in this field are the same to prevent errors."
msgstr ""
"Päivämäärä, jolloin lasku luotiin. Varmista virheiden välttämiseksi, että "
"kentän :guilabel:`Numero` vuosi ja tämän kentän vuosi ovat samat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:430
msgid "Due Date"
msgstr "Eräpäivä"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:431
msgid ""
"Date the invoice/bill is due. Each invoice/bill can have either a due date "
"or payment terms, but not both."
msgstr ""
"Päivämäärä, jolloin lasku/ostolasku erääntyy. Kullakin laskulla/ostolaskulla "
"voi olla joko eräpäivä tai maksuehdot, mutta ei molempia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:433
msgid "Payment Terms"
msgstr "Maksuehdot"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:434
msgid ""
"The :doc:`payment terms <customer_invoices/payment_terms>` of the invoice/"
"bill. Each invoice/bill can have either a due date or payment terms, but not "
"both. Payment terms are only recommended for open invoices/bills if they are "
"used with payment installments."
msgstr ""
"Laskun/ostolaskun :doc:`maksuehdot <customer_invoices/payment_terms>`. "
"Kullakin laskulla/ostolaskulla voi olla joko eräpäivä tai maksuehdot, mutta "
"ei molempia. Maksuehtoja suositellaan avoimille laskuille/ostolaskuille "
"vain, jos niitä käytetään maksuerien kanssa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:438
msgid ""
"(Optional) The journal name, if multiple sales journals or multiple purchase "
"journals exist"
msgstr ""
"(Valinnainen) Päiväkirjan nimi, jos myyntipäiväkirjoja tai ostopäiväkirjoja "
"on useita"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:439
msgid "Invoice Lines / Label"
msgstr "Laskurivit / Nimike"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:440
msgid "A label for the invoice (e.g., `Open Invoices`)"
msgstr "Laskun nimike (esim. `Open Invoices`)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:441
msgid "Invoice Lines / Account"
msgstr "Laskurivit / Tili"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:442
msgid "The receivable clearing account"
msgstr "Saamisten selvitystili"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:443
msgid "Invoice Lines / Unit Price"
msgstr "Laskurivit / Yksikköhinta"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:444
msgid ""
"The total amount due on the invoice. If partial payments have been made, "
"this is for the remaining amount due (i.e., total minus partial payments)."
msgstr ""
"Laskun erääntyvä kokonaissumma. Jos osamaksuja on tehty, tämä koskee "
"jäljellä olevaa erääntyvää summaa (eli kokonaissumma miinus osamaksut)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:447
msgid ""
"Currency the invoice was issued in (if different from the company currency). "
"If importing open invoices with different currencies, create "
"a :ref:`historical exchange rate <multi-currency/manual-update>` for each "
"invoice in a different currency before importing."
msgstr ""
"Valuutta, jossa lasku on laadittu (jos eri kuin yrityksen valuutta). Jos "
"tuot avoimia laskuja eri valuutoissa, luo jokaiselle eri valuutassa olevalle "
"laskulle :ref:`historiallinen vaihtokurssi <multi-currency/manual-update>` "
"ennen tuontia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:452
msgid ""
"To identify accounts when not using account codes, replace "
"the :guilabel:`Invoice Lines / Account` field with :guilabel:`Invoice "
"Lines / Account / External ID` and identify the account by "
"its :ref:`external ID <export_import_data/different-ids>`."
msgstr ""
"Jos et käytä tilikoodeja, tunnista tilit korvaamalla "
"kenttä :guilabel:`Laskurivit / Tili` kentällä :guilabel:`Laskurivit / Tili / "
"Ulkoinen tunniste` ja tunnista tili sen :ref:`ulkoisen tunnisteen "
"<export_import_data/different-ids>` perusteella."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:459
msgid "Validate invoices and bills"
msgstr "Vahvista myynti- ja ostolaskut"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:461
msgid ""
"Validate the following aspects of the open invoices, bills, credit notes, "
"and refunds:"
msgstr ""
"Tarkista seuraavat seikat avoimista myyntilaskuista, ostolaskuista, "
"hyvityslaskuista ja hyvityksistä:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:463
msgid ""
"The sum of open bills minus the sum of open refunds equals the balance of "
"accounts payable on the accounts payable of the opening trial balance."
msgstr ""
"Avointen ostolaskujen summa vähennettynä avointen hyvitysten summalla vastaa "
"ostovelkojen saldoa avaavan koetaseen ostoveloissa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:465
msgid ""
"The sum of open invoices minus the sum of open credit notes equals the "
"balance of the accounts receivable on the opening trial balance."
msgstr ""
"Avointen myyntilaskujen summa vähennettynä avointen hyvityslaskujen summalla "
"vastaa myyntisaamisten saldoa avaavassa koetaseessa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:467
msgid "Check for negative invoices and bills:"
msgstr "Tarkista negatiiviset myynti- ja ostolaskut:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:469
msgid ""
"If any invoices are for negative amounts, they are credit notes and should "
"be imported separately as a positive value under "
"the :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Credit Notes` menu. Change "
"the :guilabel:`Number` from `INV/YEAR/NUMBER` to `RINV/YEAR/NUMBER`, and "
"(optionally) change the :guilabel:`Reference` to `Reversal of: [INV Number]`."
msgstr ""
"Jos myyntilaskuissa on negatiivisia summia, ne ovat hyvityslaskuja ja ne "
"tulisi tuoda erikseen positiivisena arvona "
"valikossa :menuselection:`Kirjanpito --> Asiakkaat --> Hyvityslaskut`. "
"Vaihda :guilabel:`Numero` arvosta `INV/YEAR/NUMBER` arvoon `RINV/YEAR/"
"NUMBER` ja (valinnaisesti) vaihda :guilabel:`Viite` muotoon `Reversal of: "
"[INV Number]`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:473
msgid ""
"Similarly, if any bills are for negative amounts, they are refunds and "
"should be imported separately as a positive value under "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Refunds` menu. Change "
"the :guilabel:`Number` from `BILL/YEAR/NUMBER` to `RBILL/YEAR/NUMBER` and "
"(optionally) change the :guilabel:`Reference` to `Reversal of: [BILL "
"Number]`."
msgstr ""
"Vastaavasti, jos ostolaskuissa on negatiivisia summia, ne ovat hyvityksiä ja "
"ne tulisi tuoda erikseen positiivisena arvona "
"valikossa :guilabel:`Kirjanpito --> Toimittajat --> Hyvitykset`. "
"Vaihda :guilabel:`Numero` arvosta `BILL/YEAR/NUMBER` arvoon `RBILL/YEAR/"
"NUMBER` ja (valinnaisesti) vaihda :guilabel:`Viite` muotoon `Reversal of: "
"[BILL Number]`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:478
msgid ""
"Check for different currencies: If importing open invoices/bills with "
"different currencies, create a :ref:`historical exchange rate <multi-"
"currency/manual-update>` for the date of creation for each invoice or bill "
"in a different currency."
msgstr ""
"Tarkista eri valuutat: Jos tuot avoimia myynti- tai ostolaskuja eri "
"valuutoissa, luo :ref:`historiallinen valuuttakurssi <multi-currency/manual-"
"update>` kullekin eri valuutassa olevalle myynti- tai ostolaskulle sen "
"luontipäivämäärälle."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:485
msgid "Import invoices and bills"
msgstr "Tuo myynti- ja ostolaskut"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:487
msgid ""
":ref:`Import <essentials/export_import_data/import-data>` the :ref:`prepared "
"fields <accounting/get_started/prep-bills>` from the appropriate menu:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Tuo <essentials/export_import_data/import-data>` :ref:`valmistellut "
"kentät <accounting/get_started/prep-bills>` asianmukaisesta valikosta:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:490
msgid ""
"For customer invoices, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> "
"Invoices`."
msgstr ""
"Siirry myyntilaskujen osalta valikkoon :menuselection:`Kirjanpito --> "
"Asiakkaat --> Laskut`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:491
msgid ""
"For vendor bills, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Bills`."
msgstr ""
"Siirry ostolaskujen osalta valikkoon :menuselection:`Kirjanpito --> "
"Toimittajat --> Ostolaskut`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:492
msgid ""
"For credit notes, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Credit "
"Notes`."
msgstr ""
"Siirry hyvityslaskujen osalta valikkoon :menuselection:`Kirjanpito --> "
"Asiakkaat --> Hyvityslaskut`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:493
msgid ""
"For vendor refunds, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> "
"Refunds`."
msgstr ""
"Siirry toimittajahyvitysten osalta valikkoon :menuselection:`Kirjanpito --> "
"Toimittajat --> Hyvitykset`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:495
msgid ""
"The records are all imported as drafts. From the resulting list view, select "
"the imported draft records, click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm Entries`."
msgstr ""
"Kaikki tietueet tuodaan luonnoksina. Valitse avautuvasta luettelonäkymästä "
"tuodut luonnostietueet, klikkaa :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Toiminnot` ja "
"klikkaa :guilabel:`Vahvista kirjaukset`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:498
msgid ""
"Repeat the process for each record type (invoices, bills, credit notes, and "
"refunds)."
msgstr ""
"Toista prosessi jokaiselle tietuetyypille (myyntilaskut, ostolaskut, "
"hyvityslaskut ja hyvitykset)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:503
msgid "Opening inventory"
msgstr "Alkuvarasto"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:506
msgid ""
"The process of creating an opening inventory count and the associated "
"inventory valuation is the same regardless of the :ref:`accounting standard "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/accounting-standards>` or :ref:`valuation "
"method <accounting/inventory-valuation/configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"Alkuvaraston laskennan ja siihen liittyvän varaston arvostuksen "
"luontiprosessi on sama riippumatta :ref:`kirjanpitostandardista <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/accounting-standards>` tai :ref:`arvostusmenetelmästä "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/configuration>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:511
msgid "The process of importing an opening inventory is done in three steps:"
msgstr "Alkuvaraston tuonti tehdään kolmessa vaiheessa:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:513
msgid ":ref:`Preparing inventory <accounting/get_started/prep-inventory>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Inventoinnin valmistelu <accounting/get_started/prep-inventory>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:514
msgid ":ref:`Validating inventory <accounting/get_started/validate-inventory>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Inventoinnin vahvistaminen <accounting/get_started/validate-inventory>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:515
msgid ":ref:`Importing inventory <accounting/get_started/import-inventory>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Inventoinnin tuominen <accounting/get_started/import-inventory>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:520
msgid "Prepare the inventory"
msgstr "Valmistele inventointi"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:522
msgid ""
"If product costs were not already included when the products were created, "
"update them, either manually in the :guilabel:`Cost` field on the product "
"form, or via an :ref:`import to update <essentials/update-data>` it."
msgstr ""
"Jos tuotteiden kustannuksia ei sisällytetty vielä tuotteita luotaessa, "
"päivitä ne joko manuaalisesti tuotelomakkeen :guilabel:`Kustannus` -kentässä "
"tai :ref:`päivitystuonnin avulla <essentials/update-data>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:527
msgid ""
"To import products that use a :abbr:`FIFO (first in first out)` costing "
"method with multiple quantities at different costs, set the cost on the "
"product form, then import the quantity at that cost. Repeat the process as "
"many times as needed, once for each different cost."
msgstr ""
"Jos haluat tuoda tuotteita, jotka käyttävät :abbr:`FIFO (ensimmäisenä "
"sisään, ensimmäisenä ulos)` -kustannuslaskentamenetelmää ja joilla on useita "
"eri kustannuksisia määriä, määritä kustannus tuotelomakkeella ja tuo sitten "
"määrä kyseisellä kustannuksella. Toista tämä prosessi tarpeen mukaan kerran "
"kutakin eri kustannusta kohden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:531
msgid ""
"Prepare the opening inventory count using the import template available in "
"Odoo. To access the import template, go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Operations --> Physical Inventory`, click the :icon:`fa-cog` "
"(:guilabel:`Actions`) icon, and click :icon:`oi-"
"download` :guilabel:`Import`. Click :icon:`oi-download` :guilabel:`Template "
"for Inventory Adjustments` to download the template."
msgstr ""
"Valmistele aloitusinventointi Odoossa saatavilla olevan tuontimallipohjan "
"avulla. Pääset tuontimallipohjaan siirtymällä "
"kohtaan :menuselection:`Varasto --> Toiminnot --> Fyysinen inventointi`, "
"napsauta :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`Toiminnot`) -kuvaketta ja "
"napsauta :icon:`oi-download` :guilabel:`Tuo`. Napsauta :icon:`oi-"
"download` :guilabel:`Varastonkorjausten mallipohja` ladataksesi mallipohjan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:544
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:574
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:208
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:226
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:238
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:257
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:269
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:98
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:403
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania.rst:113
msgid "Product"
msgstr "Tuote"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:545
msgid ""
"The product name or internal reference. If using :doc:`product variants "
"<../../sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants>`, identifying the "
"product is more complicated as multiple variants could have the same product "
"name. In this case, it is recommended to use the :ref:`external ID "
"<export_import_data/different-ids>` to identify the product and change the "
"column name to `Product / External ID`."
msgstr ""
"Tuotteen nimi tai sisäinen viite. Jos käytössä on :doc:`tuotevariantteja "
"<../../sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants>`, tuotteen "
"tunnistaminen on monimutkaisempaa, koska useilla varianteilla voi olla sama "
"tuotenimi. Tässä tapauksessa suositellaan käyttämään :ref:`ulkoista "
"tunnistetta <export_import_data/different-ids>` tuotteen tunnistamiseen ja "
"vaihtamaan sarakkeen nimeksi `Product / External ID`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:550
msgid "Counted"
msgstr "Laskettu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:551
msgid "The quantity of products in the opening inventory count"
msgstr "Tuotteiden määrä aloitusinventoinnissa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:552
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Sijainti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:553
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Locations` feature has been enabled in the settings, it is "
"required to specify where each line of the opening inventory is located."
msgstr ""
"Jos asetuksissa on otettu käyttöön :guilabel:`Sijainnit` -toiminto, jokaisen "
"aloitusinventoinnin rivin sijainti on määritettävä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:555
msgid "Lot/Serial Number"
msgstr "Erä-/sarjanumero"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:556
msgid ""
"If the product is tracked by lot or serial numbers, specify the lot or "
"serial number here. Each unique lot or serial number requires its own line."
msgstr ""
"Jos tuotetta seurataan erä- tai sarjanumeroilla, määritä erä- tai "
"sarjanumero tähän. Jokainen yksilöllinen erä- tai sarjanumero vaatii oman "
"rivinsä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:562
msgid "Validate the inventory"
msgstr "Vahvista inventointi"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:564
msgid ""
"Verify that the sum of the opening trial balance values of all inventory "
"accounts equals the sum of the value of the inventory. The value of the "
"inventory is calculated by multiplying the product cost by the product "
"quantity for each line and summing them together."
msgstr ""
"Varmista, että kaikkien varastotilien avaavan koetaseen arvojen summa vastaa "
"varaston arvoa. Varaston arvo lasketaan kertomalla kunkin rivin tuotteen "
"kustannus tuotteen määrällä ja laskemalla ne yhteen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:575
msgid "Counted quantity"
msgstr "Laskettu määrä"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:576
msgid "Product cost"
msgstr "tuotteen hinta"

