"Harjoituksessa 1 <inventory/avg_cost/ex-1>`, "
"valitsemalla :guilabel:`Varastoyhteenveto`, "
"napsauttamalla :guilabel:`Vastaanotot` ja valitsemalla haluttu vastaanotto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:211
msgid ""
"Then, click :guilabel:`Return` on the validated delivery order, and modify "
"the quantity to `1` in the reverse transfer window. This creates an outgoing "
"shipment for the table. Select :guilabel:`Validate` to confirm the outgoing "
"shipment."
msgstr ""
"Napsauta sitten :guilabel:`Palauta` vahvistetussa toimitustilauksessa ja "
