#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:126
msgid ""
"*Avalara Included* is an affordable in-app tax calculation service designed "
"for small and medium-sized businesses with essential tax compliance needs. "
"Built on *Avalara's AvaTax* platform, it integrates with Odoo to provide "
"real-time, region-specific tax calculations for sales, purchases, and "
"invoices."
msgstr ""
"*Avalara Included* on edullinen sovelluksen sisäinen veronlaskentapalvelu "
"pienille ja keskisuurille yrityksille, joilla on perustason verosäännösten "
"noudattamistarpeita. Se perustuu *Avalaran AvaTax* -alustaan ja integroituu "
"Odooseen tarjotakseen reaaliaikaiset, aluekohtaiset verolaskelmat "
"myynneille, ostoille ja laskuille."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:131
msgid ""
"*Avalara Included* is available for databases/companies with locations in "
"the United States and Canada."
msgstr ""
"*Avalara Included* on saatavilla tietokannoille/yrityksille, joiden "
"toimipaikat sijaitsevat Yhdysvalloissa ja Kanadassa."

