#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:139
msgid ""
"Businesses that exceed 5,000 transactions annually must instead use "
"an :ref:`accounting/avalara/direct` plan to ensure uninterrupted service at "
"higher transaction volumes. To migrate from *Avalara Included* to *Avalara "
"Direct*, speak with your account manager."
msgstr ""
"Yritysten, joiden tapahtumamäärä ylittää 5 000 tapahtumaa vuodessa, on sen "
"sijaan käytettävä :ref:`accounting/avalara/direct` -sopimusta palvelun "
"keskeytymättömyyden varmistamiseksi suuremmilla tapahtumamäärillä. "
"Siirtyäksesi *Avalara Included* -sopimuksesta *Avalara Direct* -sopimukseen "
"ota yhteyttä asiakasvastaavaasi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:143
msgid ""
"In :doc:`multicompany environments <../../../general/companies/"
"multi_company>`, *Avalara Included* credentials cannot be shared between "
"companies. Instead, :ref:`create a unique Avalara Included account "
"<accounting/avalara/included-create>` with a unique email address for each "
"individual company in the database."
msgstr ""
"Usean :doc:`yrityksen ympäristöissä <../../../general/companies/"
"multi_company>` *Avalara Included* -tunnuksia ei voi jakaa yritysten kesken. "
"Sen sijaan :ref:`luo yksilöllinen Avalara Included -tili <accounting/avalara/"
"included-create>` yksilöllisellä sähköpostiosoitteella jokaiselle "
"tietokannan yritykselle erikseen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:151
msgid "In-App purchase credits"
msgstr "Sovelluksen sisäisten ostojen krediitit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:153
msgid ""
"*Avalara Included* requires users to purchase credits on the `Odoo IAP page "
"<https://iap.odoo.com/iap/in-app-services/865>`_."
msgstr ""
"*Avalara Included* edellyttää käyttäjien ostavan krediittejä `Odoon IAP-"
"sivulta <https://iap.odoo.com/iap/in-app-services/865>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:156
msgid ""
"One credit is consumed every time an invoice or credit note is posted with "
"an Avatax fiscal position. Select the package that best fits the demand, "
"based on the estimated number of transactions."
msgstr ""
"Yksi krediitti kuluu aina, kun lasku tai hyvityslasku vahvistetaan Avatax-"
"verotusasemalla. Valitse tarpeeseen parhaiten sopiva paketti arvioidun "
"tapahtumamäärän perusteella."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:165
msgid ""
"*Avalara Included* is available both for Odoo users who do not yet have an "
"Avalara account and need to :ref:`create <accounting/avalara/included-"
"create>` one and for Odoo users with an existing Avalara account that they "
"would like to :ref:`migrate <accounting/avalara/included-migrate>` to the "
"*Avalara Included* plan."
msgstr ""
"*Avalara Included* on saatavilla sekä Odoo-käyttäjille, joilla ei vielä ole "
"Avalara-tiliä ja joiden täytyy :ref:`luoda <accounting/avalara/included-"
"create>` sellainen, että Odoo-käyttäjille, joilla on olemassa oleva Avalara-"
"tili ja jotka haluavat :ref:`siirtää <accounting/avalara/included-migrate>` "
"sen *Avalara Included* -sopimukseen."

