msgstr "Tuonti-vienti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:140
msgid ""
"While on the :ref:`avalara/portal-transactions`, click :icon:`fa-"
"download` :guilabel:`Import transactions` or :icon:`fa-"
"upload` :guilabel:`Export transactions` to import or export transactions."
msgstr ""
"Kun olet :ref:`avalara/portal-transactions`, napsauta :icon:`fa-"
"download` :guilabel:`Import transactions` tai :icon:`fa-"
"upload` :guilabel:`Export transactions` tuodaksesi tai viedäksesi tapahtumia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:146
msgid ""
"To access reporting, navigate to the :menuselection:`Reports` link in the "
"top menu of the Avalara management console. Next, select from one of the "
"available reporting tabs: :guilabel:`Transactions "
"reports`, :guilabel:`Liability & tax return reports`, "
"or :guilabel:`Exemption reports`."
msgstr ""
"Raportteihin pääsee siirtymällä Avalara-hallintakonsolin "
"ylävalikon :menuselection:`Reports`-linkkiin. Valitse sitten jokin "
"saatavilla olevista raporttivälilehdistä: :guilabel:`Transactions "
"reports`, :guilabel:`Liability & tax return reports` "
"tai :guilabel:`Exemption reports`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:151
msgid ""
"Additionally, there is a :guilabel:`Favorites` tab and :guilabel:`Downloads` "
"tab. The :guilabel:`Favorites` tab contains any favorited report "
"configurations for the Avalara user. The :guilabel:`Downloads` tab contains "
"a list view where the user can download the high-volume transaction reports "
"created in the last 30 days."
msgstr ""
"Lisäksi käytettävissä on :guilabel:`Favorites`-välilehti "
"ja :guilabel:`Downloads`-välilehti. :guilabel:`Favorites`-välilehdellä ovat "
"Avalara-käyttäjän suosikkeihin lisäämät "
"raporttimääritykset. :guilabel:`Downloads`-välilehdellä on luettelonäkymä, "
"josta käyttäjä voi ladata viimeisten 30 päivän aikana luodut suurien "
"transaktiovolyymien raportit."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:156
msgid ""
"Make a selection for the :guilabel:`Report Category`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Report Name`, under the :guilabel:`Select a report` section."
msgstr ""
"Valitse :guilabel:`Report Category` ja :guilabel:`Report "
"Name` :guilabel:`Select a report`-osiossa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:159
msgid ""
"Next, fill out the :guilabel:`Select report details` section. These options "
"will vary based on the tab selected above."
msgstr ""
"Täytä seuraavaksi :guilabel:`Select report details`-osio. Nämä vaihtoehdot "
"vaihtelevat yllä valitun välilehden mukaan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:162
msgid ""
"Depending on the report size, the following two options are available in the "
"section labeled, :guilabel:`Select the approximate number of transactions "
"for your report`: :guilabel:`Create and download the report instantly` (for "
"small reports) and :guilabel:`Create and download the report in the "
"background` (for larger reports). Select one or the other depending on the "
"volume of transactions in this report."
msgstr ""
"Raportin koosta riippuen osiossa :guilabel:`Select the approximate number of "
"transactions for your report` on kaksi vaihtoehtoa: :guilabel:`Create and "
"download the report instantly` (pienille raporteille) ja :guilabel:`Create "
"and download the report in the background` (suuremmille raporteille). "
"Valitse kumpi tahansa raportin transaktiovolyymista riippuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:168
msgid ""
"Finally, under the section labeled, :guilabel:`Report preview and export` "
"make a selection of the file type to download. Either a :guilabel:`.PDF` "
"or :guilabel:`.XLS` can be chosen. Alternatively, the file can be previewed "
"by selecting the :guilabel:`Preview` option."
msgstr ""
"Lopuksi valitse osiossa :guilabel:`Report preview and export` ladattavan "
"tiedoston tyyppi. Voit valita joko :guilabel:`.PDF`- tai :guilabel:`.XLS`-"
"tiedoston. Vaihtoehtoisesti voit esikatsella tiedostoa "
"valitsemalla :guilabel:`Preview`-vaihtoehdon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:172
msgid ""
"After making all the configurations, click :guilabel:`Create report` to "
"download the report. Click :icon:`fa-star-o` :guilabel:`Make this report a "
"favorite` to save the report configuration to the user's favorites."
msgstr ""
"Kun kaikki määritykset on tehty, lataa raportti "
"napsauttamalla :guilabel:`Create report`. Tallenna raporttimääritys "
"käyttäjän suosikkeihin napsauttamalla :icon:`fa-star-o` :guilabel:`Make this "
"report a favorite`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:176
msgid ""
"After the report is created, click :icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`Download` "
"to download the file to the device."
msgstr ""
"Kun raportti on luotu, lataa tiedosto laitteellesi napsauttamalla :icon:`fa-"
"download` :guilabel:`Download`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:180
msgid ""
"Select a pre-configured report from the :guilabel:`Frequently used reports` "
"section of the reporting dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Valitse esimääritetty raportti raportointikoontinäytön :guilabel:`Frequently "
"used reports`-osiosta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:183
msgid ""
"Access this list by clicking on the :guilabel:`Reports` option in the top "
"menu of the Avalara management console, and scroll to the bottom of the page."
msgstr ""
"Pääset tähän luetteloon napsauttamalla Avalara-hallintakonsolin "
"ylävalikon :guilabel:`Reports`-vaihtoehtoa ja vierittämällä sivun alaosaan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:187
msgid ""
"`See Avalara's documentation: Reports in AvaTax <https://"
"community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=rjq1671176624730&topicId=Reports_in_AvaTax.html&_LANG=enus>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Katso Avalaran dokumentaatio: Reports in AvaTax <https://"
"community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=rjq1671176624730&topicId=Reports_in_AvaTax.html&_LANG=enus>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:191
msgid "Add more jurisdictions"
msgstr "Lisää lainkäyttöalueita"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:193
msgid ""
"Additional jurisdictions (tax locations) can be added in the Avalara "
"management console. Navigate to either Avalara's `sandbox <https://"
"sandbox.admin.avalara.com/>`_ or `production <https://admin.avalara.com/>`_ "
"environment. This will depend on which type of account was set in "
"the :doc:`integration <../avalara>`."
msgstr ""
"Lisää lainkäyttöalueita (verosijainteja) voidaan lisätä Avalara-"
"hallintakonsolissa. Siirry joko Avalaran `sandbox <https://"
"sandbox.admin.avalara.com/>`_- tai `production <https://admin.avalara.com/"
">`_-ympäristöön. Tämä riippuu siitä, minkä tyyppinen tili "
"asetettiin :doc:`integraatiossa <../avatax>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:198
msgid ""
"Next, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> Where you collect tax`. "
"Choose between the three different tabs, depending on the business need. The "
"first tab is :guilabel:`Sales and use tax`, where tax can be collected for "
"the United States. Click the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add to where you "
"collect sales and use tax` to add another location where the company "
"collects sales and use tax."
msgstr ""
"Siirry seuraavaksi kohtaan :menuselection:`Settings --> Where you collect "
"tax`. Valitse kolmesta eri välilehdestä liiketoimintatarpeen mukaan. "
"Ensimmäinen välilehti on :guilabel:`Sales and use tax`, jossa voidaan kerätä "
"veroa Yhdysvalloissa. Lisää toinen sijainti, jossa yritys kerää myynti- ja "
"käyttöveroa, napsauttamalla :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add to where you "
"collect sales and use tax`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:203
msgid ""
"The second option, is the :guilabel:`VAT/GST` tab where the :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`Add a country or territory where you collect VAT/GST` can "
"be selected to add another country or territory where the company collects "
"VAT/GST."
msgstr ""
"Toinen vaihtoehto on :guilabel:`VAT/GST`-välilehti, jossa voidaan "
"valita :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add a country or territory where you "
"collect VAT/GST` lisätäksesi toisen maan tai alueen, jossa yritys kerää "
"ALV:tä/GST:tä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:207
msgid ""
"Finally, on the far-right, is the :guilabel:`Customs duty` tab, where a "
"country can be added where the company collects customs duty. Simply click "
"on the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add a country where you calculate customs "
"duty` icon below the tab."
msgstr ""
"Lopuksi oikealla on :guilabel:`Customs duty`-välilehti, jossa voidaan lisätä "
"maa, jossa yritys kerää tullimaksuja. Napsauta yksinkertaisesti välilehden "
"alla olevaa :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add a country where you calculate "
"customs duty`-kuvaketta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:211
msgid ""
"AvaTax management console, on the Where you collect tax page, with the add "
"button and\n"
"sales and use tax tab highlighted."
msgstr ""
"AvaTax-hallintakonsoli Where you collect tax -sivulla, jossa lisää-painike "
"ja sales and use tax -välilehti on korostettu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:217
msgid ""
"`See Avalara's documentation: Add local jurisdiction taxes <https://"
"community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=bla1700809896571_bla1700809896571&topicId=nbw1698727575499.html&_LANG=enus>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Katso Avalaran dokumentaatio: Add local jurisdiction taxes <https://"
"community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=bla1700809896571_bla1700809896571&topicId=nbw1698727575499.html&_LANG=enus>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:221
msgid "Tax exemption certificate"
msgstr "Verovapautustodistus"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:223
msgid ""
"Tax exemption certificates for customers can be added into the Avalara "
"management console, so that *AvaTax* is aware of which customers may be "
"exempt from paying certain taxes. To add an *exception certificate* navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Exemptions --> Customer certificates`. From there, click "
"on the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add a certificate` to configure an "
"exemption."
msgstr ""
"Asiakkaiden verovapautustodistuksia voidaan lisätä Avalara-"
"hallintakonsoliin, jotta *AvaTax* tietää, mitkä asiakkaat voivat olla "
"vapautettuja tiettyjen verojen maksamisesta. Lisää *poikkeustodistus* "
"siirtymällä kohtaan :menuselection:`Exemptions --> Customer certificates`. "
"Napsauta siellä :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add a certificate` määrittääksesi "
"vapautuksen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:229
msgid ""
"An Avalara subscription to Exemption Certificate Management (ECM) is "
"required in order to attach certificate images, and to be ready for an "
"audit. For more on subscribing to this add-on, visit `Avalara <https://"
"community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=hff1682048150115_hff1682048150115&topicId=fol1682356576230.html&_LANG=enus>`_."
msgstr ""
"Exemption Certificate Management (ECM) -tilaus Avalaralta vaaditaan, jotta "
"voidaan liittää todistuskuvia ja olla valmiina tarkastukseen. Lisätietoja "
"tähän lisäosaan tilaamisesta on osoitteessa `Avalara <https://"
"community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=hff1682048150115_hff1682048150115&topicId=fol1682356576230.html&_LANG=enus>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:235
msgid "End-of-year operations"
msgstr "Tilivuoden lopun toiminnot"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:237
msgid ""
"Avalara's services include tax return services, for when it is time to file "
"taxes at the end of the year. To access Avalara's tax services log, into the "
"`management portal <https://admin.avalara.com/>`_. Then, from the main "
"dashboard, click :guilabel:`Returns`. Avalara will prompt the Avalara user "
"to log in for security purposes, and redirect the user to the *Returns* "
"portal."
msgstr ""
"Avalaran palveluihin kuuluvat veroilmoituspalvelut tilivuoden lopussa "
"verojen ilmoittamista varten. Avataksesi Avalaran veropalvelulokin, kirjaudu "
"`hallintaportaaliin <https://admin.avalara.com/>`_. Napsauta sitten "
"pääkoontinäytöltä :guilabel:`Returns`. Avalara kehottaa käyttäjää "
"kirjautumaan sisään turvallisuussyistä ja ohjaa käyttäjän *Returns*-"
"portaaliin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:243
msgid "Avalara portal with the returns shortcut highlighted."
msgstr "Avalara-portaali, jossa Returns-pikakuvake on korostettuna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:247
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Get started` to begin the tax return process. For more "
"information, refer to this Avalara documentation: `About Managed Returns "
"<https://community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=hps1656397152776_hps1656397152776&topicId=Learn_about_Managed_Returns.html&_LANG=enus>`_."
msgstr ""
"Napsauta :guilabel:`Get started` aloittaaksesi veroilmoitusprosessin. "
"Lisätietoja saat Avalaran dokumentaatiosta: `About Managed Returns <https://"
"community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=hps1656397152776_hps1656397152776&topicId=Learn_about_Managed_Returns.html&_LANG=enus>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:252
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click on the :menuselection:`Returns` button in the top menu "
"of the Avalara management console."
msgstr ""
"Vaihtoehtoisesti napsauta Avalaran hallintakonsolin "
"ylävalikon :menuselection:`Returns`-painiketta."

