msgstr "Lasku B: 600 $ lykättäväksi 1.1.2023–31.12.2023"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:134
msgid ""
"Bill C: $600 to be deferred in a future period (it will appear on "
"the :guilabel:`Not Started` column)"
msgstr ""
"Lasku C: 600 $ jaksotetaan tulevalle kaudelle (se näkyy :guilabel:`Ei "
"aloitettu` -sarakkeessa)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:143
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:160
msgid ""
"Line 1: Expense account -1200 -600 -600 = **-2400** (cancelling the total of "
