"Line 2: Expense account 100 + 50 = **150** (recognizing 1/12 of bill A and "
"bill B)"
msgstr "Rivi 2: Kulutili 100 + 50 = **150** (kirjataan 1/12 laskuista A ja B)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:150
msgid "Line 1: Expense account **2400**"
msgstr "Rivi 1: Kulujen tili **2400**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:151
msgid "Line 3: Expense account **-150**"
msgstr "Rivi 3: Kulujen tili **-150**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:161
msgid ""
"Line 2: Expense account 200 + 100 = **300** (recognizing 2/12 of bill A and "
"bill B)"
msgstr "Rivi 2: Kulutili 200 + 100 = **300** (kirjataan 2/12 laskuista A ja B)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:176
msgid "Bill A and Bill B"
msgstr "Lasku A ja lasku B"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:179
msgid "Bill C will be deferred later"
msgstr "Lasku C jaksotetaan myöhemmin"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:181
msgid ""
"Therefore, at the end of December, bills A and B are fully recognized as "
"expense only once in spite of all the created entries thanks to the reversal "
"mechanism."
msgstr ""
"Joulukuun lopussa laskut A ja B kirjataan täysin kuluksi vain kerran "
