msgid ""
"For new incoming third-party checks, click :guilabel:`Add a line` in "
"the :guilabel:`Incoming Payments` tab and select :guilabel:`New Third Party "
"Checks`. This method is used to create *new* third-party checks."
msgstr ""
"Jos kyseessä ovat uudet saapuvat kolmannen osapuolen sekit, napsauta "
