#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1090
msgid ""
"Once all configurations are set, the *Liquidity Product Vendor Bill* will be "
"generated by the company selling the product on behalf of another party. For "
"example, a distributor of a specific product."
msgstr ""
"Kun kaikki määritykset on tehty, tuotetta toisen osapuolen puolesta myyvä "
