msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendor --> Payments`, access the "
"relevant payments, and select the :guilabel:`EFT/CPA transaction code` for "
"each payment."
msgstr ""
"Siirry kohtaan :menuselection:`Kirjanpito --&gt; Tavarantoimittajat --&gt; "
