#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:385
msgid ""
"As part of the localization module, taxes are created automatically with "
"their related financial account and configuration. These taxes can be "
"managed from :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"Osana lokalisointimoduulia verot luodaan automaattisesti niihin liittyvine "
"kirjanpitotileineen ja asetuksineen. Näitä veroja voidaan hallita "
"kohdassa :menuselection:`Kirjanpito --> Asetukset --> Verot`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:389
msgid "Chile has several tax types, the most common ones are:"
msgstr "Chilellä on useita verotyyppejä, yleisimmät ovat:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:391
msgid "**VAT**: the regular VAT can have several rates."
msgstr "**ALV**: tavallisella ALV:lla voi olla useita verokantoja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:392
msgid "**ILA**: the tax for alcoholic drinks."
msgstr "**ILA**: alkoholijuomien vero."

