#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:38
msgid ""
"The Chinese localization package ensures compliance with Chinese fiscal and "
"accounting regulations. It includes tools for managing taxes, fiscal "
"positions, reporting, and a predefined chart of accounts tailored to China's "
