"kirjanpitostandardien mukaan räätälöity esimääritetty rakenne"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:47
msgid ":ref:`Reporting <localizations/china/reporting>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Raportointi <localizations/china/reporting>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:48
msgid ""
":ref:`Taxes <localizations/china/taxes>`: pre-configured tax rates, "
"including standard VAT, zero-rated, and exempt options"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Verot <localizations/china/taxes>`: esimääritetyt verokannat, mukaan "
"lukien yleinen arvonlisävero, nollaverokanta ja verottomat vaihtoehdot"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:50
msgid ""
":doc:`../accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions`: automated tax mapping based on "
"the fapiao type for domestic customers and suppliers, and a dedicated fiscal "
"position for foreign ones"
msgstr ""
":doc:`../accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions`: fapiao-tyyppiin perustuva "
"automaattinen verokohdistus kotimaisille asiakkaille ja toimittajille sekä "
"erillinen fiskaalinen positio ulkomaisille toimijoille"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:58
msgid ""
"Two independent :doc:`charts of accounts <../accounting/get_started/"
"chart_of_accounts>` are available, depending on the selected :ref:`fiscal "
"localization package <fiscal_localizations/packages>`: :guilabel:`China - "
"Accounting Standards for Business Enterprises` and :guilabel:`China - "
"Accounting Standards for Small Business Enterprises`."
msgstr ""
"Käytettävissä on kaksi erillistä :doc:`tilikarttaa <../accounting/"
"get_started/chart_of_accounts>` valitun :ref:`taloushallinnon "
"lokalisointipaketin <fiscal_localizations/packages>` mukaan: "
":guilabel:`China - Accounting Standards for Business Enterprises` ja "
":guilabel:`China - Accounting Standards for Small Business Enterprises`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:68
msgid ""
"Each :ref:`fiscal localization package <fiscal_localizations/packages>` "
"includes dedicated :ref:`Balance Sheet <accounting/reporting/balance-sheet>` "
"and :ref:`Profit and Loss <accounting/reporting/profit-and-loss>` reports, "
"based on the corresponding :ref:`chart of accounts <localizations/china/"
"chart_of_accounts>`."
msgstr ""
"Jokainen :ref:`taloushallinnon lokalisointipaketti <fiscal_localizations/"
"packages>` sisältää erilliset :ref:`taseen <accounting/reporting/balance-"
"sheet>` ja :ref:`tuloslaskelman <accounting/reporting/profit-and-loss>` "
"raportit, jotka perustuvat vastaavaan :ref:`tilikarttaan <localizations/"
"china/chart_of_accounts>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:73
msgid ""
"To access these reports, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting` and "
"select :guilabel:`Balance Sheet` or :guilabel:`Profit and Loss`."
msgstr ""
"Pääset näihin raportteihin siirtymällä kohtaan "
":menuselection:`Laskentatoimi --> Raportointi` ja valitsemalla "
":guilabel:`Tase` tai :guilabel:`Tuloslaskelma`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:81
msgid ""
"Both :ref:`packages <fiscal_localizations/packages>` share the same pre-"
"configured :doc:`taxes <../accounting/taxes>`. To view them, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"Molemmat :ref:`paketit <fiscal_localizations/packages>` käyttävät samoja "
"esimääritettyjä :doc:`veroja <../accounting/taxes>`. Voit tarkastella niitä "
"siirtymällä kohtaan :menuselection:`Laskentatoimi --> Asetukset --> Verot`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:85
msgid ""
"The taxes are designed to feed the :ref:`tax report <localizations/china/"
"accounting/tax_report>`. Most taxes and tax grids are assigned to a line "
"of :guilabel:`Schedule 1 - Sales Details` or :guilabel:`Schedule 2 - Input "
"Tax Details`, so that amounts are classified and totaled automatically. The "
"tables below show the schedule line for each tax."
msgstr ""
"Verot on suunniteltu kerryttämään :ref:`veroraporttia <localizations/china/"
"accounting/tax_report>`. Useimmat verot ja veroruudukot on määritetty "
"riville :guilabel:`Schedule 1 - Sales Details` tai :guilabel:`Schedule 2 - "
"Input Tax Details`, jotta summat luokitellaan ja lasketaan yhteen "
"automaattisesti. Alla olevissa taulukoissa näkyy kunkin veron erittelyrivi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:90
msgid ""
"Each tax name follows a pattern that identifies the tax rate or treatment, "
"the type of supply or purchase, and the supporting document: a **fapiao** "
"(:dfn:`official invoice issued through the Electronic Tax Bureau`) or a "
"receipt. Understanding this pattern simplifies the search for the right tax."
msgstr ""
"Kunkin veron nimi noudattaa kaavaa, joka määrittää verokannan tai -"
"käsittelyn, toimitus- tai ostotyypin sekä tositteen: **fapiao** "
"(:dfn:`sähköisen verotoimiston kautta annettu virallinen lasku`) tai kuitti. "
"Tämän kaavan ymmärtäminen helpottaa oikean veron löytämistä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:96
msgid ""
"To choose the right tax, first determine whether the transaction is a sale "
"or a purchase:"
msgstr "Valitse oikea vero määrittämällä ensin, onko tapahtuma myynti vai osto:"

