"-raportille ja napsauta sitten :guilabel:`ATS`. Lataa sen jälkeen ladattu "
"XML-tiedosto *DIMM Formularios* -järjestelmään."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:420
msgid ""
"When downloading the :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional Simplificado)` report, "
"Odoo generates a warning pop-up alerting the user if a document(s) has "
"missing or incorrect data. Nevertheless, the XML file can still be "
"downloaded."
msgstr ""
"Ladattaessa :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional Simplificado)` -raporttia Odoo "
