#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1013
msgid ""
"This company must also be set as the user's :guilabel:`Default Company`, as "
"Teledec always synchronizes with the user's default company."
msgstr ""
"Tämän yrityksen on myös oltava asetettu käyttäjän :guilabel:`oletusyritys`, "
