#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1118
msgid "Odoo certification"
msgstr "Odoo-sertifiointi"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1120
msgid ""
"The tax administration requires all companies to provide a certificate of "
"conformity confirming that their software complies with anti-fraud "
"legislation. In case of non-compliance, a €7,500 fine may be imposed."
msgstr ""
"Veroviranomaiset vaativat kaikilta yrityksiltä "
"vaatimustenmukaisuustodistuksen, joka vahvistaa, että niiden ohjelmisto "
"täyttää petostentorjuntalainsäädännön vaatimukset. Vaatimustenvastaisen "
"toiminnan tapauksessa voidaan määrätä 7 500 euron sakko."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1125
msgid ""
"This `certificate <https://www.odoo.com/my/contract/french-certification/>`_ "
"is granted by Odoo SA to Odoo Enterprise users with a subscription number."
msgstr ""
"Tämän `todistuksen <https://www.odoo.com/my/contract/french-certification/"
">`_ myöntää Odoo SA Odoo Enterprise -käyttäjille, joilla on tilausnumero."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1128
msgid "To get the certification, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Hanki sertifiointi seuraavasti:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1130
msgid ""
":doc:`Install </applications/general/apps_modules>` the :guilabel:`France - "
"VAT Anti-Fraud Certification for Point of Sale (CGI 286 I-3 bis)` "
"(`l10n_fr_pos_cert`) module."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Asenna </applications/general/apps_modules>` :guilabel:`France - VAT "
"Anti-Fraud Certification for Point of Sale (CGI 286 I-3 bis)` "
"(`l10n_fr_pos_cert`) -moduuli."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1132
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Country` field on the :doc:`company record </applications/"
"general/companies>` to encrypt entries for the inalterability check."
msgstr ""
"Aseta :guilabel:`maa` -kenttä :doc:`yritystietueeseen </applications/general/"
"companies>` salaamaan merkinnät muuttumattomuustarkastusta varten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1134
msgid ""
"Download the mandatory `certificate of conformity <https://www.odoo.com/my/"
"contract/french-certification/>`_ delivered by Odoo SA."
msgstr ""
"Lataa pakollinen `vaatimustenmukaisuustodistus <https://www.odoo.com/my/"
"contract/french-certification/>`_, jonka on toimittanut Odoo SA."

