msgstr "`l10n_de`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:21
msgid ""
"German :ref:`fiscal localization package <fiscal_localizations/packages>`. "
"By default, the audit trail is enabled to ensure compliance with GoBD."
msgstr ""
