#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Germany - Certification for Point of Sale of type restaurant`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Saksa - Ravintolatyyppisen kassajärjestelmän sertifiointi`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:31
msgid "`l10n_de_pos_res_cert`"
msgstr "`l10n_de_pos_res_cert`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:32
msgid ""
"Adds the new regulatory requirements specifically related to the restaurant "
"industry in Germany."
msgstr ""
"Lisää erityisesti Saksan ravintola-alaan liittyvät uudet "
"viranomaisvaatimukset."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:45
msgid ""
"The German localization package ensures compliance with German fiscal and "
"accounting regulations. It includes tools for managing taxes, fiscal "
"positions, and reporting, as well as a predefined chart of accounts tailored "
"to Germany’s standards."
msgstr ""
"Saksan lokalisointipaketti varmistaa Saksan vero- ja kirjanpitosäännösten "
"noudattamisen. Se sisältää työkalut verojen, verokantojen ja raportoinnin "
"hallintaan sekä Saksan standardeihin mukautetun esimääritetyn tilikartan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:49
msgid ""
"The German localization package provides the following key features to "
"ensure compliance with local fiscal and accounting regulations:"
msgstr ""
"Saksan lokalisointipaketti tarjoaa seuraavat keskeiset toiminnot "
"paikallisten vero- ja kirjanpitosäännösten noudattamiseksi:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:52
msgid ":ref:`Chart of accounts<localizations/germany/coa>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Tilikartta<localizations/germany/coa>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:57
msgid ":ref:`Reporting <localizations/germany/reporting>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Raportointi <localizations/germany/reporting>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:64
msgid ""
"Both SKR03 and SKR04 :doc:`charts of accounts <../accounting/get_started/"
"chart_of_accounts>` are supported in Odoo. When a new Odoo Online database "
"is created, SKR03 is installed by default."
msgstr ""
"Odoo tukee sekä SKR03- että SKR04-:doc:`tilikarttoja <../accounting/"
"get_started/chart_of_accounts>`. Kun uusi Odoo Online -tietokanta luodaan, "
"SKR03 asennetaan oletuksena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:67
msgid ""
"To verify which is installed, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` and check the :guilabel:`Package` field under "
"the :guilabel:`Fiscal Localization` section."
msgstr ""
"Tarkistaaksesi, kumpi on asennettu, siirry "
"kohtaan :menuselection:`Kirjanpito --> Asetukset --> Asetukset` ja tarkista "
"kenttä :guilabel:`Paketti` osiosta :guilabel:`Verotuksellinen lokalisointi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:71
msgid ""
"Selecting another package is only possible if no accounting entries have "
"been created. If one was posted, a new company or database must be set up to "
"select another package. In addition, all journal entries will need to be "
"created again."
msgstr ""
