#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:250
msgid ""
":ref:`Customer credit <accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-note>` "
"and :ref:`debit notes <accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-note>` can be "
"issued either:"
