#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:795
msgid "Bill of Entry (BOE)"
msgstr "Bill of Entry (BOE)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:797
msgid ""
"A Bill of Entry (:abbr:`BOE (Bill of Entry)`) is a legal document filed by "
"importers with the customs department to declare imported goods, assessable "
"values, customs duties, and import taxes. In Odoo, creating a Bill of Entry "
"generates a customs vendor bill and allocates customs duties to the related "
"stock receipts using landed costs."
msgstr ""
"Tulli-ilmoitus (:abbr:`BOE (Bill of Entry)`) on maahantuojien "
"tulliviranomaiselle jättämä virallinen asiakirja tuontitavaroiden, "
"tullausarvojen, tullimaksujen ja tuontiverojen ilmoittamista varten. Odoossa "
"tulli-ilmoituksen luominen muodostaa tulliostolaskun ja kohdistaa "
"tullimaksut niihin liittyville varastovastaanotoille lisäkulujen (landed "
"costs) avulla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:803
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Indian - Bill Of Entry` (`l10n_in_boe`) module "
"is :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Varmista, että moduuli :guilabel:`Indian - Bill Of Entry` (`l10n_in_boe`) on "
":ref:`asennettu <general/install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:805
msgid ""
"The imported products must use the :guilabel:`First In First Out (FIFO)` "
"or :guilabel:`Average Cost (AVCO)` costing method."
msgstr ""
"Tuotujen tuotteiden arvostusmenetelmänä on oltava :guilabel:`FIFO (First In "
"First Out)` tai :guilabel:`Keskihinta (AVCO)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:808
msgid "To create a Bill of Entry, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Luo tulli-ilmoitus seuraavasti:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:810
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Bills` and open a posted "
"vendor bill with its :guilabel:`GST Treatment` set to :guilabel:`Overseas` "
"(or select multiple posted overseas vendor bills for the same vendor and "
"currency from the list view, and click :menuselection:`Action --> Bill of "
"Entry`)."
msgstr ""
"Siirry kohtaan :menuselection:`Laskutus --> Toimittajat --> Ostolaskut` ja "
"avaa kirjattu ostolasku, jonka :guilabel:`GST Treatment` -asetuksena on "
":guilabel:`Overseas` (tai valitse luettelonäkymästä useita kirjattuja "
"ulkomaisia ostolaskuja samalle toimittajalle ja valuutalle, ja valitse "
":menuselection:`Toiminto --> Bill of Entry`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:814
msgid ""
":ref:`Match the relevant purchase order to the vendor bill <accounting/"
"vendor_bills/vendor-bills-matching-po>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Kohdista asianmukainen ostotilaus ostolaskuun <accounting/vendor_bills/"
"vendor-bills-matching-po>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:815
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Bill Of Entry` to open the wizard and fill in the required "
"details:"
msgstr ""
"Avaa ohjattu toiminto napsauttamalla :guilabel:`Bill Of Entry` ja täytä "
"vaaditut tiedot:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:817
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Transfers`: Select the validated (:guilabel:`Done`) incoming "
"stock receipts linked to the purchase."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Siirrot`: Valitse vahvistetut (:guilabel:`Valmis`) ostoon "
"liittyvät saapuvat varastovastaanotot."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:819
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: Verify the document currency and conversion rate if it "
"differs from the company currency."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Valuutta`: Tarkista asiakirjan valuutta ja muuntokurssi, jos se "
"eroaa yrityksen valuutasta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:821
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bill of Entry Number`, :guilabel:`Bill of Entry Date`, "
"and :guilabel:`Port Code`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bill of Entry Number`, :guilabel:`Bill of Entry Date` ja "
":guilabel:`Port Code`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:823
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Lines` tab, review the :guilabel:`Assessable Value` for "
"each product line, enter the :guilabel:`Custom Duty`, and select the "
"applicable purchase :guilabel:`Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"Tarkista :guilabel:`Rivit` -välilehdellä kunkin tuoterivin "
":guilabel:`Assessable Value`, syötä :guilabel:`Custom Duty` ja valitse "
"sovellettavat oston :guilabel:`Verot`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:825
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr "Napsauta :guilabel:`Vahvista`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:827
msgid ""
"A draft Bill of Entry vendor bill is created for the customs duty and import "
"tax, and a linked landed cost record is generated to allocate the customs "
"duty across the selected transfers."
msgstr ""
"Tullimaksusta ja tuontiverosta luodaan luonnostilainen tulliostolasku, ja "
"siihen liittyvä lisäkulukirjaus muodostetaan tullimaksun kohdistamiseksi "
"valituille siirroille."

