msgid "How to configure :doc:`Bank Accounts <../accounting/bank>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Pankkitilien <../accounting/bank>` määrittäminen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:817
msgid "Accept Ri.Ba. for your invoices"
msgstr "Hyväksy Ri.Ba. laskuillesi"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:819
msgid ""
"Payments of type |Ri.Ba.| can be registered from the :guilabel:`Invoices` "
