#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:60
msgid ""
"The Netherlands localization package ensures compliance with Dutch fiscal "
"and accounting regulations. It includes tools for managing taxes, fiscal "
"positions, reporting, and a predefined chart of accounts tailored to Dutch "
"standards."
msgstr ""
"Alankomaiden lokalisointipaketti varmistaa Alankomaiden vero- ja "
"kirjanpitosäännösten noudattamisen. Se sisältää työkalut verojen, "
"verokantojen, raportoinnin sekä Alankomaiden standardien mukaan räätälöidyn "
"esimääritetyn tilikartan hallintaan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:64
msgid "The Dutch localization package provides the following key features:"
msgstr ""
"Alankomaiden lokalisointipaketti tarjoaa seuraavat keskeiset ominaisuudet:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:66
msgid ""
":ref:`Chart of accounts <localizations/netherlands/chart-of-accounts>`: a "
"predefined structure tailored to Dutch accounting standards."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Tilikartta <localizations/netherlands/chart-of-accounts>`: "
"Alankomaiden kirjanpitostandardien mukaan räätälöity esimääritetty rakenne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:68
msgid ""
":ref:`Taxes <localizations/netherlands/taxes>`: pre-configured tax rates, "
"including standard VAT, zero-rated, and exempt options."
