"tarvitaan :doc:`Stripe-pääte <../../../applications/sales/point_of_sale/"
"payment_methods/terminals/stripe>`. Odoo tukee **EFTPOS**-maksuratkaisua."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:338
msgid ""
"A Stripe payment terminal is not needed to use Odoo as the main POS system. "
