msgstr ""
"Varmista, että :guilabel:`Saudi Arabia - E-invoicing (Simplified) "
"(l10n_sa_edi_pos)` -moduuli on :ref:`asennettu <general/install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:588
msgid ""
"PoS orders must be properly reported in compliance with ZATCA Phase 2. To do "
