#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:64
msgid "Updated VAT for January 2025"
msgstr "Päivitetty ALV tammikuulle 2025"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:66
msgid ""
"Starting from the 1st January 2025, new increased VAT rates are applied in "
"Switzerland. The normal 8.0% rate switched to 8.1% and the specific rate for "
"the hotel sector switched to 3.8%. Basic needs goods have a reduced rate of "
"2.6% applied."
msgstr ""
"Sveitsissä sovelletaan 1. tammikuuta 2025 alkaen uusia korotettuja "
"arvonlisäverokantoja. Yleinen 8,0 %:n kanta nousi 8,1 %:iin ja hotellialan "
"erityiskanta 3,8 %:iin. Perustarvikkeisiin sovelletaan 2,6 %:n alennettua "
"verokantaa."

