msgid ""
"An arbitrary alphanumerical :guilabel:`Sequence Prefix` can be set. The "
"system uses only the last three characters of that prefix. The prefix must "
"contain at least three characters; any shorter prefix is automatically "
"denied by the system."
msgstr ""
