#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:751
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Bank accounts` field in the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab should "
"now display the newly added bank account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pankkitilit`-kentän :guilabel:`Kirjanpito`-välilehdellä pitäisi "
"nyt näyttää juuri lisätty pankkitili."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:754
msgid "Enter the company/vendor bank account information, then click Save."
msgstr ""
