#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:764
msgid "Select the correct :guilabel:`Bank Account Type` (checking or savings)."
msgstr ""
"Valitse oikea :guilabel:`Pankkitilin tyyppi` (sekkitili tai säästötili)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:765
msgid ""
"Select the preferred :guilabel:`Direct Deposit Transfer Type` for the vendor/"
"destination account. Pricing can be verified directly in Wise."
msgstr ""
"Valitse toimittajan/kohteen tilille ensisijainen :guilabel:`Suorien "
