msgstr ""
"Wise tarjoaa `hiekkalaatikkoympäristön <https://wise-sandbox.com>`_ "
"ominaisuuksien ja integraatioiden testaamiseen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:775
msgid ""
"Select the appropriate environment to ensure accurate results (*sandbox* for "
"testing, *production* for real transactions)."
msgstr ""
"Valitse sopiva ympäristö varmistaaksesi tarkat tulokset (*sandbox* "
"testaukseen, *production* todellisiin tapahtumiin)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:779
msgid "Pay vendor bills with direct deposit"
msgstr "Maksa toimittajalaskut suoralla talletuksella"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:781
msgid ""
"After configuring direct deposit in both Wise and Odoo, vendor payments can "
"be created individually in the Odoo database, batched for transfer, and then "
"paid in Wise."
msgstr ""
"Kun suoramaksu on määritetty sekä Wisessa että Odoossa, toimittajamaksuja "
