#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:787
msgid ""
":doc:`Create a batch payment <../accounting/payments/batch>`. Batch payments "
"can include payments from multiple vendors."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Luo eräsiirto <../accounting/payments/batch>`. Eräsiirrot voivat "
"sisältää maksuja useilta toimittajilta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:789
msgid ""
"Confirm the :guilabel:`Batch Type` is :guilabel:`Outbound`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Initiate payment`. Odoo will redirect to Wise."
msgstr ""
"Varmista, että :guilabel:`Batch Type` on :guilabel:`Outbound`, ja "
"napsauta :guilabel:`Initiate payment`. Odoo ohjaa Wiseen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:792
msgid ""
"Sign into the Wise account if needed, and see all the pending transactions."
msgstr ""
"Kirjaudu Wise-tilille tarvittaessa ja tarkastele kaikkia odottavia "
