#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:37
msgid ""
"**DGI**: *Dirección General Impositiva* is the government entity responsible "
"for enforcing tax payments in Uruguay."
msgstr ""
"**DGI**: *Dirección General Impositiva* on hallituksen taho, joka vastaa "
"veronmaksujen valvonnasta Uruguayssa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Uruware**: is the third-party organization that facilitates the "
