#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:38
msgid ""
":ref:`Taxes <localizations/uz/taxes>`: preconfigured tax rates, including "
"standard 12% VAT, zero-rated export, and exempt options"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Daně <localizations/uz/taxes>`: předkonfigurované daňové sazby, včetně "
"standardní 12% DPH, nulové sazby pro export a osvobozených možností"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:40
msgid ""
":ref:`Chart of accounts <localizations/uz/coa>`: preconfigured structure "
"aligned with Uzbek standards"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Účtová osnova <localizations/uz/coa>`: předkonfigurovaná struktura "
