#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/vietnam.rst:214
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Reverse and Create Invoice` to issue a replacement invoice, "
"or :guilabel:`Reverse` to issue an adjustment invoice."
msgstr ""
"Napsauta :guilabel:`Palauta ja luo lasku` lähettääksesi korvaavan laskun "
