#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:13
msgid "Configuration on APS Dashboard"
msgstr "Määritykset APS-koontinäytössä"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:15
msgid ""
"Log into your `Amazon Payment Services Dashboard <https://fort.payfort.com/"
">`_ and go to :menuselection:`Integration Settings --> Security Settings`. "
"Generate the :guilabel:`Access Code` if none has been generated yet. Copy "
"the values of the :guilabel:`Merchant Identifier`, :guilabel:`Access "
"Code`, :guilabel:`SHA Request Phrase` and :guilabel:`SHA Response Phrase` "
"fields, and save them for later."
msgstr ""
"Kirjaudu sisään `Amazon Payment Services -koontinäyttöösi <https://"
"fort.payfort.com/>`_ ja siirry kohtaan :menuselection:`Integration Settings "
"--> Security Settings`. Luo :guilabel:`Access Code`, jos sitä ei ole vielä "
"luotu. Kopioi kenttien :guilabel:`Merchant Identifier`, :guilabel:`Access "
"Code`, :guilabel:`SHA Request Phrase` ja :guilabel:`SHA Response Phrase` "
"arvot ja tallenna ne myöhempää käyttöä varten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:20
msgid ""
"Enter your Odoo database URL in the :guilabel:`Origin URL`, for example: "
"`https://yourcompany.odoo.com/`. Then, click on :guilabel:`Save Changes`."
msgstr ""
"Syötä Odoo-tietokantasi URL-osoite kenttään :guilabel:`Origin URL`, "
"esimerkiksi: `https://yourcompany.odoo.com/`. Napsauta "
"sitten :guilabel:`Save Changes`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:22
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Integration Settings --> Technical Settings` and "
