#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:7
msgid ""
"`DPO Pay <https://dpogroup.com/>`_ is a payment provider based in Africa "
"that operates across multiple countries on the continent."
msgstr ""
"`DPO Pay <https://dpogroup.com/>`_ on Afrikassa toimiva "
"maksupalveluntarjoaja, joka toimii useissa maanosan maissa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:13
msgid "DPO Pay account creation"
msgstr "DPO Pay -tilin luominen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:15
msgid ""
"`Fill in the DPO Pay onboarding form <https://dpo-pay-network.odoo.com/"
"form>`_ and upload the required documents."
msgstr ""
"`Täytä DPO Pay -liittymislomake <https://dpo-pay-network.odoo.com/form>`_ ja "
"lataa vaaditut asiakirjat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:17
msgid ""
"Agree to the :guilabel:`Terms and Conditions` and click :guilabel:`Submit`."
msgstr "Hyväksy :guilabel:`Käyttöehdot` ja napsauta :guilabel:`Lähetä`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:18
msgid ""
"DPO Pay creates a test account based on the submitted information and sends "
"you an email containing your login credentials for the `DPO portal <https://"
"portal.dpopay.com>`_ and the :ref:`test credentials <payment_providers/test-"
"mode>` to enter in :ref:`Odoo <payment_providers/dpo/configure_odoo>` if you "
"want to try DPO Pay without affecting live transactions."
msgstr ""
"DPO Pay luo testitilin lähetettyjen tietojen perusteella ja lähettää sinulle "
"sähköpostiviestin, joka sisältää kirjautumistietosi `DPO-portaaliin <https://"
"portal.dpopay.com>`_ ja :ref:`testitunnukset <payment_providers/test-mode>`, "
"jotka syötetään :ref:`Odoo <payment_providers/dpo/configure_odoo>`-"
"järjestelmään, jos haluat kokeilla DPO Pay -palvelua vaikuttamatta "
"todellisiin tapahtumiin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:23
msgid ""
"Once DPO has verified the information and documents, they will transition "
"your test account to a live account and send another email containing your "
"live credentials to configure in :ref:`Odoo <payment_providers/dpo/"
"configure_odoo>`."
msgstr ""
"Kun DPO on vahvistanut tiedot ja asiakirjat, he siirtävät testitilisi "
"aktiiviseksi tiliksi ja lähettävät toisen sähköpostiviestin, joka sisältää "
"aktiiviset tunnuksesi, jotka määritetään :ref:`Odoo <payment_providers/dpo/"
"configure_odoo>`-järjestelmässä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:32
msgid ""
":ref:`Navigate to the payment provider DPO Pay <payment_providers/add_new>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Siirry maksupalveluntarjoajaan DPO Pay <payment_providers/add_new>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:33
msgid ""
"Fill in the :guilabel:`Service ID` and :guilabel:`Company Token` fields with "
"the :ref:`information received from DPO Pay <payment_providers/dpo/"
"configure_dashboard>`."
msgstr ""
"Täytä kentät :guilabel:`Palvelun tunnus` "
"ja :guilabel:`Yritystunnus` :ref:`DPO Pay -palvelusta saaduilla tiedoilla "
"<payment_providers/dpo/configure_dashboard>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:35
msgid "Configure the remaining options to your liking."
msgstr "Määritä loput asetukset haluamallasi tavalla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:36
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`State` field to :guilabel:`Enabled` (or :guilabel:`Test "
"Mode` if you are trying DPO Pay as a :ref:`test <payment_providers/test-"
"mode>`)."
msgstr ""
"Aseta :guilabel:`Tila` -kentän arvoksi :guilabel:`Käytössä` "
"(tai :guilabel:`Testitila`, jos kokeilet DPO Pay -palvelua :ref:`testinä "
"<payment_providers/test-mode>`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:40
msgid ""
"All `payment methods supported by DPO Pay <https://dpogroup.com/Payment-"
"methods>`_ are grouped under the :guilabel:`Card / Mobile` payment method. "
"When they select this payment method, customers are redirected to a DPO Pay "
"page where they can select their preferred payment method. To enable or "
"disable specific payment options, contact `DPO Pay support <https://"
"dpogroup.com/contact-us/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Kaikki `DPO Pay -palvelun tukemat maksutavat <https://dpogroup.com/Payment-"
"methods>`_ on ryhmitelty maksutavan :guilabel:`Kortti / Mobiili` alle. Kun "
"asiakkaat valitsevat tämän maksutavan, heidät ohjataan DPO Pay -sivulle, "
"jossa he voivat valita haluamansa maksutavan. Ota yhteyttä `DPO Pay -tukeen "
"<https://dpogroup.com/contact-us/>`_, jos haluat ottaa käyttöön tai poistaa "
"käytöstä tiettyjä maksuvaihtoehtoja."

